title: "PICC web measurement tool"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
abstract: >-
  A web-based tool for collecting expert endpoint measurements, with
  per-item timing, on chest radiographs. Built to provide the reader arm
  of an AI-versus-radiologist comparison for PICC insertion-length
  prediction.
